什么？蝗灾！\n&陈宫\n是的，濮阳一带的庄稼全部被吃光了，\n现在一粒米也收不到了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n嗯……。\n&陈宫\n主公，攻打我方的曹操军队，\n一定也苦于粮草不继的窘况，\n所以不会来攻打我们。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈宫\n看来我们只有暂时休兵，\n等待下季收获吧。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n好吧，这也是不得已的事。\n那就暂时休兵，等待时机吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n公台，传令全军。\n从今天起要节约粮食，\n违者严惩！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈宫\n是。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[205,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":2,"offset":980,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":982,"title":"汝南  镇压","body_off":1003,"body_end":2721,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["汝南  镇压"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[16]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[1,65535,0,65535,65535]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[119,416,63]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[0,480,63]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[145,482,150]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["此时，",0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["徐州太守陶谦已死，",1,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":43,"name":"op_2b","args":[145]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["依照他临终时的嘱托，",1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[32,482,150]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["刘备继任为徐州太守。",1,0,1]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,21,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,49,67,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,38,54,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[16,38,46,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[18,38,38,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,60,54,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[22,60,46,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[21,60,38,3,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[205,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["濮阳郊外  曹操军主营"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n奉孝，还有多少粮食？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n大约还能维持一个月吧。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,40,54,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n由于克扣军粮，\n士兵中已生怨言了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n主公，我们暂时离开濮阳，\n去汝南怎么样？\n&曹操\n汝南？\n&荀彧\n是的。那里没有遭受蝗灾，\n粮草很充足。\n&曹操\n可是，不能向百姓强征粮食啊。\n&荀彧\n汝南现在有黄巾余党胡作非为。\n&荀彧\n我看如果我们铲除了这些山贼，\n百姓大概就愿意给我军供应粮食了。\n&荀彧\n如此也能搏得朝廷的好感，\n提高主公的威望。\n不知主公意下如何？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n是啊，我们虽然军粮不足，\n不过那些山贼还不是我们的对手。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,3,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n这可真是一石二鸟的妙计。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n还不只这样呢，夏侯将军，\n也许可以一石三鸟。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n什么？此话怎讲？\n&荀彧\n主公，听说汝南的村中有个勇猛的大汉，\n人称虎痴。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n如果有他加入我军，\n我军的实力一定会更加强大。\n&曹操\n哦，虎痴……？\n"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好吧，全军开赴汝南。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[205,255]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[16]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[1,65535